{"version":1,"content":"<p>今天（11月2日），多名香港中文大學學生發帖稱，當天上午，菲爾茲獎新晉得主王虹現身學校領獎，很多人都來聽講座、合影。</p><p>該活動系求是科技基金會頒獎儀式，王虹榮獲2026求是傑出科學家獎。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T14:41:30.054448+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":92,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T13:51:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T16:38:18.576059+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T14:38:17.867842+00:00","content_hash":"fc29225adebc68afd1df7fbc0161b8d9b9edb7ce2621441a6f20fed88f7cbd40","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}